# Configuration reference.
#
# The site is a fully static Next.js app (static export, deployed to GitHub
# Pages). There is no build-time dependency on secrets. Everything below is
# documented in MAINTENANCE.md.

# --- Build-time (used to generate sitemap, robots, canonical links, metadata) ---

# Canonical site URL. If unset, falls back to https://www.nabin-dhungana.com.np.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.nabin-dhungana.com.np

# --- Optional serverless API (in the `api/` folder, Azure Functions) ---
#
# The deployed site on GitHub Pages does NOT run the `/api` serverless backend.
# That backend is an optional, separately deployed companion (see README.md and
# MAINTENANCE.md). If you deploy it and want the front end to use it, set:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# --- Server-side secrets for the optional API (NEVER put real values here) ---
#
# If you deploy the `api/` functions, provide these as app-settings on whatever
# host runs them. They are never compiled into the browser bundle.

# AZURE_TABLES_CONNECTION_STRING   Azure Storage or Cosmos DB Table connection string
# SENDGRID_API_KEY                 SendGrid API key used to deliver contact emails
# SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL              Verified SendGrid sender address
# SENDGRID_FROM_NAME               (optional) Sender display name
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL                 (optional, default nabinnd@gmail.com) contact recipient
